WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:14.790
This is just so funny. I told you in our discussion
of the bogus summary of the Trump phone call

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:21.689
with the Ukrainian president that if the white
house thinks that the summary is not incriminating,

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:26.570
just imagine how bad the full transcript would
be if it were released. There is a new report

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:33.140
out now that onald Trump was incredulous and
shocked earlier this week that when he sent

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.680
a transcript of the phone call to Nancy Pelosi,
she didn't read it and immediately call off

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:42.579
the impeachment inquiry. This is how out of
touch the guy is. How disconnected from reality

00:00:42.579 --> 00:00:49.350
do you have to be to send something to Nancy
Pelosi that confirms everything that has been

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:54.250
reported is true, or at least it certainly
doesn't disabuse anyone of that belief, and

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:58.680
then you're shocked that Nancy Pelosi didn't
read it and say, you know what? Now that I've

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:03.170
seen what Donald's sent over, I'm going to
cancel the entire impeachment inquiry.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:08.030
It's also interesting that there are reports
from close to Trump that even though he believes

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:12.570
impeachment might help him politically in
wenty twenty he still doesn't want to be impeached,

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:17.350
and we'll talk more about that when things
settle down a little bit around the whistleblower

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:23.560
report, but the real amazing thing here is
the degree to which onald Trump believes that

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:29.440
he is endlessly convincing. Think back, this
is a personality trait that made Trump say

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:33.530
a year ago or whenever. Sure. I'll sit down
with obert Mueller. That's no problem. I'll

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:38.830
go talk to him in person. Trump believes that
he is so convincing that he is so charismatic

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:45.640
that he is so articulate and a quick thinker
on his feet that people can't tell that he's

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:50.380
lying, that he can just get in a room with
whoever and he can say something or he can

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.060
show something in this case a transcript to
Nancy Pelosi and that they will be immediately

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.060
overwhelmed by what he is saying or showing
them and they will come over to his point

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.060
of view.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:05.170
And thus he was stunned according to this
report that Nancy Pelosi didn't immediately

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:10.280
cancel the impeachment inquiry because of
what onald Trump sent her. Just another little

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:17.450
a a notch in our understanding of how onald
Trump operates and it certainly is consistent

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:18.450
with everything that we've seen so far.

